                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: justify;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent: 42px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important"><span style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 15px;font-family: 宋体;font-variant-numeric: normal;font-variant-east-asian: normal;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important">为进一步丰富同学们的校园艺术活动，绍兴一中教育集团开展了历时三周的校园文化艺术节。12月14日，校园文化艺术节闭幕式暨迎新文艺汇演圆满落下帷幕。学校各级领导、家长代表以及高一、高二年段师生共飨这场文化艺术盛宴。</span></p><p style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 24px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: "PingFang SC", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Helvetica Neue", "Hiragino Sans GB", "Microsoft YaHei UI", "Microsoft YaHei", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left; visibility: visible; text-indent: 2em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;">本次汇演分高二、高一两个专场。校领导班子成员俞奇弘、杨佩琼分别出席了高二、高一专场并代表学校致辞：向所有为艺术节辛勤工作的老师和同学们致以衷心感谢，向所有精心筹备节目并通过遴选登上舞台的班级表示热烈祝贺！</span>
</p><p style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: justify;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent: 42px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important"><span style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 15px;font-family: 宋体;font-variant-numeric: normal;font-variant-east-asian: normal;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important">俞奇弘指出，文艺是滋养心灵、塑造灵魂的重要方式，同学们通过参加艺术节活动，发掘和培养了自己的兴趣和特长，在实践中锻炼了组织协调能力、团队合作精神和创新能力，将有助于同学们更好地走向成功与幸福。</span></p><p style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;text-align: justify;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 2em;line-height: 1.5em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important"><span style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 15px;font-family: 宋体;font-variant-numeric: normal;font-variant-east-asian: normal">杨佩琼肯定了艺术节中同学们在唱歌、书法、绘画、摄影等比赛中的精彩表现，并嘱咐他们在今后的学习生活中不要忽视自身艺术修养的提升，要努力做一个中华优秀文化的传承者、传播者，厚植家国情怀，不负伟大时代。</span></p><p style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important"><span style="font-family: Calibri; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.034em; text-indent: 42px; text-align: justify;">本次汇演共有34场节目，分为歌曲、舞蹈、相声、舞台剧、课本剧等形式。</span>
</p><p>
</p><section><article><section><section><section><section><section><p style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important"><strong style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important"><span style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 210px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important">“音” 为有你，青春飞扬</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section>
</section></section></section></section></article></section><p>
</p><p style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: justify;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent: 2em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important"><span style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 15px"><span style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Calibri;font-variant-numeric: normal;font-variant-east-asian: normal;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important">歌唱类表演涵盖了丰富多样的形式与风格，充分展现了同学们多元的音乐才华。电声乐队演绎的《稻香》瞬间将现场气氛点燃；《天地龙鳞》、《阳光开朗大男孩》等表演洋溢着满满的青春活力；合唱社成员们用内心最真挚的情感诠释《星辰大海》；校十佳歌手演唱《逆光》等歌曲。同学们在歌声中感受到了勇气与力量，即使逆着光，也要勇敢地追寻自己的梦想与希望。</span>    </span></p><p>
</p><section><article><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><span style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-weight: 600;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 15px;text-indent: 196px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important">  </span> </section></section></section></section></section></article></section><section><article><section><section><section><section><section><p style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important"><strong style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important"><span style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 210px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important">“舞” 彩缤纷，艺韵生风</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section></article></section><p>
</p><p style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: justify;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent: 2em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important"><span style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: 宋体;font-variant-numeric: normal;font-variant-east-asian: normal;font-size: 15px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important">舞蹈类表演以独特的创意编排和富有张力的肢体语言感染着在场的观众，如《舞青春绮梦，逐人生浪豗》、《跃动送青春，相思寄明月》。团队成员间默契配合，服装造型与舞蹈风格相得益彰，增强了舞台视觉效果，极富感染力。《代代风华》的服饰秀更是惊艳全场，宛如一部生动的时尚编年史书，带领观众领略了中华民族不同年代的服饰文化魅力与文化底蕴。</span></p><p>
</p><section><article><section><section><section></section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section></article><p style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important">
</p></section><section><article><section><section><section><section><section><p style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important"><strong style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important"><span style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.51px;text-align: center;text-indent: 210px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important">“剧” 焦舞台，逗趣生活</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section>
</section></section></section></section></article></section><p>
</p><p style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: justify;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent: 2em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important"><span style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 15px;font-family: 宋体;font-variant-numeric: normal;font-variant-east-asian: normal;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important">课本剧《黑羊》以戏剧之镜，照人性幽微；话剧《失彩症》以其独特的创意和深刻的内涵，深深触动了观众的心灵；小品《音乐课最重要》以其幽默诙谐的风格和发人深省的内涵，赢得了同学们的阵阵欢笑与热烈掌声；</span><span style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 15px"><span style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: 宋体;font-variant-numeric: normal;font-variant-east-asian: normal;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important">更有将经典童话的故事元素融入到传统表演形式的相声《白雪公主》；歌伴剧《有我》宛如一颗璀璨新星，他们用真挚的情感将青春的热血、梦想的追逐展现得淋漓尽致。</span></span></p><section><article><section><section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important">
</p></section></section></article></section><section><article><section><section><section><section><section><p style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important"><strong style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important"><span style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.51px;text-indent: 224px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important">墨香画影，艺蕴校园</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section>
</section></section></section></section></article></section><p>
</p><p style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: justify;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent: 2em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important"><span style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Calibri;font-variant-numeric: normal;font-variant-east-asian: normal;font-size: 15px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important">本次校园文化艺术节分期开展了书法、美术、摄影等比赛，同学们用他们丰富的想象力、精湛的技艺以及对生活与美的独特感悟带给我们一场场精彩纷呈的视觉艺术盛宴。</span><span style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.034em">  </span></p><section><section><article><section><section><section><section><p style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important">
</p></section></section></section></section></article></section><p style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;text-indent: 2em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important"><span style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.034em">本届艺术盛会让我们明白，艺术并非遥不可及的星辰，而是校园生活中不可或缺的一抹亮色。</span><span style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.034em">艺术节虽已结束，但艺术的种子已深深播撒在每一位学子的心间，相信在艺术的熏陶下，我校学子将以更加饱满的热情、更加昂扬的姿态，在学业与人生的舞台上，演绎出属于自己的精彩华章！</span></p></section><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/12/202412180842478643.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202412180842478643.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/12/202412180842479279.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202412180842479279.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/12/202412180842477179.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202412180842477179.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/12/202412180842480011.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202412180842480011.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/12/202412180842478953.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202412180842478953.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/12/202412180842503643.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202412180842503643.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/12/202412180842513983.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202412180842513983.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/12/202412180842480440.jpg" style=